/guid><pubDate>2026-08-29T23:08:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133617031,imgsize-142324.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Haunted Drake’s Island with Grade-II listed house, 6.4-acre site, tunnels goes on sale for over £2M]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133615939.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Drake’s Island, a 6.4-acre historic island in Plymouth Sound, Devon, has gone on sale for offers above £2 million. The former military site features a Grade-II listed Governor’s House, underground tunnels, Tudor fortifications and planning consent for a 43-bed hotel. Fortified in the 16th century, the island also has a mysterious, reportedly haunted past.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/haunted-drakes-island-tiny-uk-island-with-grade-ii-listed-house-6-4-acre-site-mysterious-underground-tunnels-and-43-bed-hotel-plan-goes-on-sale-for-offers-above-2-million/articleshow/133615939.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/haunted-drakes-island-tiny-uk-island-with-grade-ii-listed-house-6-4-acre-site-mysterious-underground-tunnels-and-43-bed-hotel-plan-goes-on-sale-for-offers-above-2-million/articleshow/133615939.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-29T22:25:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133615999,imgsize-156506.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Pakistan hospital fire: 8 officials suspended over deaths of 14 newborns]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133615824.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA